      "rect" : [
        86.412100000000009,
        465.63263999999992,
        453.74475200000029,
        13.784640000000024
      ],
      "text" : "Testimony: YOU ARE COMMANDED to appear at the time, date, and place set forth below to testify at a"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 9.9600000000000009,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        72.019920000000013,
        454.43759999999992,
        468.01143599999961,
        13.416119999999978
      ],
      "text" : "deposition to be taken in the above-captioned cases. If you are an organization that is not a party in this case, you must"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 9.9600000000000009,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        72.009960000000007,
        442.91387999999989,
        468.04430400000012,
        13.416119999999978
      ],
      "text" : "designate one or more officers, directors, or managing agents, or designate other persons who consent to testify on"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 9.9600000000000009,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        72.009959999999978,
        431.39015999999987,
        302.52902399999971,
        13.416119999999978
      ],
      "text" : "your behalf about the following matters, or those set forth in an attachment:"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 9.9600000000000009,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        77.640000000000001,
        407.94227999999998,
        24.375107999999997,
        13.416119999999978
      ],
      "text" : "Place:"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 9.9600000000000009,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        311.40000000000003,
        407.94227999999998,
        62.288880000000006,
        13.416119999999978
      ],
      "text" : "Date and Time:"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 9.9600000000000009,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        100.8043,
        361.49855999999994,
        439.24498399999993,
        13.416140000000041
      ],
      "text" : "The deposition will be recorded by this method: _________________________________________________"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 9.9600000000000009,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        86.402200000000008,
        338.45107999999999,
        453.51859999999988,
        13.416159999999934
      ],
      "text" : "Production: You, or your representatives, must also bring with you to the deposition the following documents,"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 9.9600000000000009,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        71.990039999999979,
        326.92739999999992,
        468.01243199999993,
        13.416119999999978
      ],
      "text" : "electronically stored information, or objects, and permit their inspection, copying, testing, or sampling of the material:"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 9.9600000000000009,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        71.990039999999965,
        315.40367999999989,
        465.04534800000027,
        13.416119999999978
      ],
      "text" : "_____________________________________________________________________________________________"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 9.9600000000000009,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        86.400000000000006,
        278.46227999999996,
        453.66405600000019,
        13.416119999999978
      ],
      "text" : "The provisions of RCFC 45(d), relating to your protection as a person subject to a subpoena, and RCFC 45(e) and"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 9.9600000000000009,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        71.99783999999994,
        266.93855999999994,
        455.48275200000018,
        13.416119999999978
      ],
      "text" : "(g), relating to your duty to respond to this subpoena and the potential consequences of not doing so, are attached."
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 9.9600000000000009,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        71.997799999999998,
        244.01064,
        144.17602000000005,
        13.416160000000019
      ],
      "text" : "Date: ________________________"
    },
